     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I think the following code reproduces a bug in poisson_rng. this should be due to an overflow in int in stan.</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed data<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameters<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed parameters<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>generated quantities<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   real</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   real                  x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lognormal_rng</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10E10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   x      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> poisson_rng</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;bug: &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>the script to run the code is</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">./</span><span style=\"color:#000\">test  sample algorithm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fixed_param num_warmup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> num_samples</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> random seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12345</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>and I got the following</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>bug</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.14748e+09</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
